{{feat
|epic=yes
|type=class
|prereq=[[epic class|epic]] [[shadowdancer]]
|desc=The character's [[summon shadow]] ability is reinforced, allowing him to call an [[epic shadowlord (summon)|epic shadowlord]] to his side. Unlike a non-epic shadowlord, an epic shadowlord is a potent fighter, reinforced by his master's lifeforce, making him stronger each time the shadowdancer gains a [[class level|level]].
|use=automatic
|icon=ife_x1sshad.gif
|bonus1=shadowdancer
}}

==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*The epic shadowlord has the same abilities and immunities as the pre-epic variety and is a fighter a level lower than the shadowdancer's level.
*This feat is only available as a shadowdancer [[epic bonus feat]], not as a [[general feat]].

===Previous versions===
*Prior to version 1.69, the epic shadowlord lacked [[concealment]], making it less effective at lower levels than its pre-epic counterpart.

==Epic shadowlord stats==

'''Damage:''' 1-8/1-8/2-12 (critical: 20 / x2)

Trained [[skill|skills]] at shadowdancer level 13: [[discipline]] (19), [[hide]] (10), [[listen]] (3), [[parry]] (19), [[taunt]] (8) 

Feats at shadowdancer level 13: [[called shot]], [[cleave]], [[darkvision]], [[disarm]], [[dodge]], [[great cleave]], [[great fortitude]], [[Improved critical|improved critical (creature)]], [[iron will]], [[knockdown]], [[mobility]], [[power attack]], [[spring attack]], [[toughness]], [[weapon proficiency (creature)]], [[Weapon specialization|weapon specialization (creature)]]

